{
  "id": 94,
  "nameSimple": "Ash-Sharh",
  "nameArabic": "الشرح",
  "nameTranslation": "The Relief",
  "revelationPlace": "makkah",
  "versesCount": 8,
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "key": "94:1",
      "textUthmani": "أَلَمْ نَشْرَحْ لَكَ صَدْرَكَ",
      "textUthmaniTajweed": "أَلَمْ نَشْرَحْ لَكَ صَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed>رَكَ <span class=end>۝١</span>",
      "textIndopak": "اَلَمۡ نَشۡرَحۡ لَـكَ صَدۡرَكَۙ‏",
      "words": [
        {
          "position": 1,
          "textUthmani": "أَلَمْ",
          "transliteration": "alam",
          "translation": "Have not",
          "charType": "word"
        },
        {
          "position": 2,
          "textUthmani": "نَشْرَحْ",
          "transliteration": "nashraḥ",
          "translation": "We expanded",
          "charType": "word"
        },
        {
          "position": 3,
          "textUthmani": "لَكَ",
          "transliteration": "laka",
          "translation": "for you",
          "charType": "word"
        },
        {
          "position": 4,
          "textUthmani": "صَدْرَكَ",
          "transliteration": "ṣadraka",
          "translation": "your breast",
          "charType": "word"
        },
        {
          "position": 5,
          "textUthmani": "١",
          "transliteration": null,
          "translation": "(1)",
          "charType": "end"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Did We not expand for you, [O Muḥammad], your breast?[1944]",
      "transliteration": "Alam nashrah laka sadrak",
      "audioUrl": "https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/094001.mp3",
      "footnotes": {
        "1944": "i.e., enlighten, assure and gladden your heart with guidance."
      },
      "translationClear": "Did We not soothe your heart?"
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "key": "94:2",
      "textUthmani": "وَوَضَعْنَا عَنكَ وِزْرَكَ",
      "textUthmaniTajweed": "وَوَضَعْنَا عَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نكَ</tajweed> وِزْرَكَ <span class=end>۝٢</span>",
      "textIndopak": "وَوَضَعۡنَا عَنۡكَ وِزۡرَكَۙ‏",
      "words": [
        {
          "position": 1,
          "textUthmani": "وَوَضَعْنَا",
          "transliteration": "wawaḍaʿnā",
          "translation": "And We removed",
          "charType": "word"
        },
        {
          "position": 2,
          "textUthmani": "عَنكَ",
          "transliteration": "ʿanka",
          "translation": "from you",
          "charType": "word"
        },
        {
          "position": 3,
          "textUthmani": "وِزْرَكَ",
          "transliteration": "wiz'raka",
          "translation": "your burden",
          "charType": "word"
        },
        {
          "position": 4,
          "textUthmani": "٢",
          "transliteration": null,
          "translation": "(2)",
          "charType": "end"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "And We removed from you your burden[1945]",
      "transliteration": "Wa-Wa-d'ana 'anka wizrak",
      "audioUrl": "https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/094002.mp3",
      "footnotes": {
        "1945": "By forgiving any errors which you may have committed previously or might commit consequently. \"Burden\" can also refer to the anxiety experienced by the Prophet (ﷺ) at the beginning of his mission."
      },
      "translationClear": "And lift from you your burden."
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "key": "94:3",
      "textUthmani": "ٱلَّذِىٓ أَنقَضَ ظَهْرَكَ",
